IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nt-schedule`

-- Tests of nt-schedule.l4 (the Schedule, and section 2(1) and (2)).
-- The first block is mechanical: for each line of the Schedule that names an instrument, the lookup finds it, and the effect is the one section 2(1) gives to Parts 1, 2 and 3 or section 2(2) gives to Part 4.
-- The second block is hand-written from the text.

§ `Mechanical: every named instrument`

#ASSERT `s 2(1), (2): what this Act does to the instrument named` "Interpretation Ordinance 1931" EQUALS JUST `repeals the instrument`
